        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 15004, Restroom Stall Door Rim Bolt and Keeper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRim door bolt typically used on commercial restroom stall doors. Locks a lavatory door for privacy in a toilet area. Packaged with installation screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of solid brass, this slide type door bolt is surface mounted (screw to the doors face). Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 15004 Restroom Stall Door Bolt and Keeper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Brass</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt Thickness: 5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt Throw: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keeper Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Keeper Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 6 each #8 x 3/4\" wood screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/15004.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 15004 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes packaged with rim door bolt and keeper. Set is for one (1) door. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>**Link to Similar </b> <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/restroom-stall-door-stainless-steel-rim-bolt-and-keeper-dwd-b15004-1269592\"><b>DWD-B15004 Stainless Steel Rim Bolt and Keeper.</b></a>\r\n</p>",
